{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264mRPSvtUHt1794532208.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國2027財政年度開局，錄得創紀錄的4,040億美元預算赤字。</p><p></p><p>美國財政部表示，由於財政收入萎縮、支出急劇增長，美國政府2027財年開局錄得4,040億美元的10月預算赤字，創下該月份的紀錄新高，較去年同期增加1,200億美元，增幅四成二。</p><p></p><p>期內，財政收入減少350億美元，減幅百分之9，至3,690億美元，部分原因是海關關稅收入由去年同期由313億美元，減至192億美元；個人非預扣稅收入按年減少三成六，至510億美元。2026財年赤字近2萬億美元，創五年來最大預算缺口。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T01:53:46.680731+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":238,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T01:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T04:49:18.110681+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T01:47:00.604466+00:00","content_hash":"31a52ca7c50a09519d80f9b71852047b144f11c4a5429794e8ab0d3637d5d9f4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T01:53:46.680731+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}